# Environment files
.env
# Catches .env.production, .env.staging and anything else of that shape. The
# repo is public; a secrets file reaching it is not recoverable by deleting the
# commit. The example files are re-included below.
.env.*
.env.local
.env.*.local
!**/.env.example
api/.env
!api/.env.example

